          <tr>
            <td class="col-key">HTTP/1.1</td>
            <td>1997</td>
            <td>TCP + TLS (sau)</td>
            <td>Keep-alive, pipelining (hiếm dùng), text protocol</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="col-key">HTTP/2</td>
            <td>2015</td>
            <td>TCP + TLS</td>
            <td>Multiplexing nhiều stream trong 1 TCP, header compression (HPACK), binary frames. <span class="ink">Bị head-of-line blocking ở TCP</span>.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="col-key">HTTP/3</td>
            <td>2022</td>
            <td>QUIC (UDP)</td>
            <td>Multiplexing per-stream (không HoL ở transport), TLS 1.3 nhúng vào QUIC, connection migration (đổi network giữ session).</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="col-key">mTLS</td>
            <td>—</td>
            <td>TLS bất kỳ</td>
